{"unit_id":"RuitongZhang__dsh-ssh-remote#card-zh","repo":"RuitongZhang/dsh-ssh-remote","commit":"82f7037440e0fe342c2ab63c6ad6fc51df84c309","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-remote 是一个面向 DSH 的 SSH 远程开发插件，通过本机 OpenSSH 连接配置好的 Linux 主机，并向 agent 注册六个远程工具。它可以执行远程 shell 命令、按行读取文本文件、创建或替换文件、按文本编辑文件，也能用 ripgrep 搜索内容并按 glob 查找路径。相对路径可从配置的远程根目录解析，读取和输出都有大小限制，命令支持超时。插件还加入系统提示，提醒 agent 在远程主机工作时使用 remote 工具。适合在本机 DSH 中开发远程 Linux 项目；需要本机 SSH 客户端及可无交互登录的远程主机。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:359-597","cordis.patch.yml:1-6"]}
{"unit_id":"RuitongZhang__dsh-ssh-remote#card-en","repo":"RuitongZhang/dsh-ssh-remote","commit":"82f7037440e0fe342c2ab63c6ad6fc51df84c309","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ssh-remote connects DSH to Linux over OpenSSH. Six tools run commands, read, write or edit files, search with ripgrep, and find paths by glob. Relative paths use a configurable remote root; reads and outputs are capped, and commands support timeouts. Requires non-interactive SSH access.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:359-597","cordis.patch.yml:1-6"]}
