{"unit_id":"RuitongZhang__dsh-ssh-remote#feature-1","repo":"RuitongZhang/dsh-ssh-remote","commit":"82f7037440e0fe342c2ab63c6ad6fc51df84c309","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-remote 的功能「远程命令」：通过 remote_bash 在 SSH 主机的登录 shell 中运行命令，可指定工作目录和超时，并返回输出及退出码。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:359-403"]}
{"unit_id":"RuitongZhang__dsh-ssh-remote#feature-2","repo":"RuitongZhang/dsh-ssh-remote","commit":"82f7037440e0fe342c2ab63c6ad6fc51df84c309","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-remote 的功能「分页读取」：通过 remote_read 按行读取远程 UTF-8 文本，可指定起始行和行数，并提供总行数信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:406-450"]}
{"unit_id":"RuitongZhang__dsh-ssh-remote#feature-3","repo":"RuitongZhang/dsh-ssh-remote","commit":"82f7037440e0fe342c2ab63c6ad6fc51df84c309","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-remote 的功能「写入远程文件」：通过 remote_write 创建或完整替换远程文本文件，自动创建父目录并以临时文件替换。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:452-477"]}
{"unit_id":"RuitongZhang__dsh-ssh-remote#feature-4","repo":"RuitongZhang/dsh-ssh-remote","commit":"82f7037440e0fe342c2ab63c6ad6fc51df84c309","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-remote 的功能「定点编辑」：通过 remote_edit 按字面文本替换远程文件内容；默认要求匹配唯一，也可选择替换全部。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:479-526"]}
{"unit_id":"RuitongZhang__dsh-ssh-remote#feature-5","repo":"RuitongZhang/dsh-ssh-remote","commit":"82f7037440e0fe342c2ab63c6ad6fc51df84c309","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-remote 的功能「搜索和文件匹配」：remote_grep 用 ripgrep 搜索远程内容，remote_glob 按 glob 查找文件，两者均限制返回数量。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:528-587"]}
